key.axolotlextras.menu=Extras Menu
axolotlextras.modernMenus=Modern Menus
axolotlextras.modernMenus.tooltip=Flat rounded buttons and a dark background in every menu, and a restyled HUD editor. Turn off to get the normal look back.
axolotlextras.hudCorners=HUD Corners
axolotlextras.hudCorners.tooltip=How round the corners of the HUD boxes are.
axolotlextras.corners.off=Square
axolotlextras.corners.small=Small
axolotlextras.corners.medium=Medium
axolotlextras.corners.large=Large
axolotlextras.privacyLock=Privacy Lock
axolotlextras.privacyLock.tooltip=Stops AxolotlClient from sending your player UUID, and the UUIDs of the players around you, to its own server, and from downloading Discord's game SDK.
axolotlextras.normalMessages=Normal Hypixel Messages
axolotlextras.normalMessages.tooltip=Shows Hypixel's own text for deaths, broken beds, eliminated teams and disconnects instead of AxolotlClient's short rewritten ones. The stats it added (a teammate's final kills or beds after their name, the stat lines under an eliminated team) are kept when real stats are loaded (Hypixel API key needed).
axolotlextras.chatStats=Chat Stats At Start
axolotlextras.chatStats.tooltip=Prints a stat for every player in the chat when a Bed Wars game starts. Needs AxolotlClient's Bed Wars module and a Hypixel API key.
axolotlextras.chatStat=Chat Stat
axolotlextras.chatStat.tooltip=The stat that goes in the chat list at the start of a game.
kdr=KDR
fkdr=FKDR
wlr=WLR
bblr=BBLR
